+/*
+ * Stained Glass OS (wine-sg 6523): every enabled SystemMediaTransportControls session is an MPRIS
+ * player (the freedesktop.org Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification) on the user's own
+ * session bus: org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.<program>.instance<pid>_<n>, with its metadata, playback
+ * status and the Can* properties from the program's IsXEnabled; Play, Pause, PlayPause, Stop,
+ * Next and Previous come back to the program as ButtonPressed. libdbus is loaded at run time;
+ * without it, or without a session bus, nothing happens. Each session has its own connection
+ * (MPRIS players all live at /org/mpris/MediaPlayer2).
+ */
+
